<H3><A NAME="HDR2">INTRODUCTION</A></H3>
<P>This section gives an introduction to the basic syntactic structure of EDIF.
<H3><A NAME="HDR3">REFERENCE</A></H3>
<P>This section lists each keyword and gives a description of each keyword, in the following sections: 

<UL>
